 ('T01-M04','Keep research and peer layers distinct; any use of Chatham House language needs a specified meeting/output mode.','No automatic research licence, identifiable publication, recording or meeting-attendance publicity.',cs('T1R2-C01','T1R2-C02','T1R2-C05')),
