(R/'04-table/T02-SECOND-CHECK-REFINEMENTS.md').write_text('''# T02 refinement brief after the second challenge

30 October2026. Supplement to the four original hypotheses; no replacement, adoption or original buyer evidence.

| Original hypothesis | Refinement before any authorised conversation | Counterevidence to preserve |
| --- | --- | --- |
| H01 Research use | Identify user, concrete decision and incremental entitlement/service beside free contributor research and actual public/internal alternatives | Equivalent access is already available, no owner/use exists, or desired evidence is infeasible |
| H02 Research partnership | Establish genuine intended benefit, audience/research fit and separate rights if funding also buys commercial access | Value depends on implied identity access, favourable findings, or an audience inconsistent with the research |
| H03 Practitioner participation | Explain relevant peer/follow-through value, role fit, permitted format and recognition/output modes | Attendance cannot be accepted, peers/topics are unsuitable, or permission cannot support the planned output |
| H04 Event value | Compare the same intended outcome across in-person, remote and written approaches; separate cohort, council and licence lifecycles | Travel/hosting adds no distinct value; staffing, evidence, rights or funding prerequisites are missing |

Keep source, competitor, distributor, buyer and funder roles specific to the exchange. Existing collaboration or public involvement does not establish new rights or a current commitment. A free practitioner report should not become paid twice in the model, and no restriction on that existing promised benefit is invented here.

Use the existing buyer/member guides selectively, with actual recent needs before reactions to an offer. No extra mandatory report questions are introduced. Six-to-ten report contributors and up-to-four exploratory Table contribution events remain the agreed separate units. The six optional conditions and all evidence links are in [the second-check readout](T01-SECOND-CHECK-READOUT.md).

No actor, event, entitlement, price, permitted transfer, collection route or launch term has been confirmed by this paper. These refinements prepare a more useful T02 design and later scoped validation, not an offer to send now.
''')
